OL,3,GNEWSATrust boss 'ashamed' over
OL,4,Amaternity data loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of a trust at the
OL,7,Fcentre of the largest maternity scandal
OL,8,Fin NHS history said he is "ashamed and
OL,9,Fembarrassed" after 215,000 records of
OL,10,Fmothers and babies were lost.
OL,12,FLast week, Nottingham University
OL,13,FHospitals NHS Trust (NUH) said it had
OL,14,Flost the historical data during routine
OL,15,FIT work. It was later recovered.
OL,17,FMaternity records of women and babies
OL,18,Fwho received care between September
OL,19,F2011 and November 2022 were overwritten
OL,20,Fduring work at the trust.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
