OL,3,GNEWSATrust boss 'ashamed' over
OL,4,Amaternity data loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FInformation has been restored since the
OL,7,F"human error" on 18 August, but the
OL,8,Ftrust has not been able to restore the
OL,9,Fhistory showing who viewed or amended
OL,10,Fmaternity records during this period.
